THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL, WHICH THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

AMD microcode images. A built RembrandtGPU.kext embeds AMD GPU firmware
images, fetched by tools/fetch_amd_fw.sh and NOT present in this repository.
They are licensed by AMD under their own terms, reproduced as that licence
requires in the release archive's LICENSE.amdgpu and inside the built bundle
at Contents/Resources/LICENSE.amdgpu. AMD's licence permits redistribution in
binary form only; it grants no right to excerpt or modify them.

Board video BIOS images. A machine's own VBIOS belongs to its board vendor.
None is in this repository (firmware/ is not tracked), and release builds carry
none: the driver reads the image out of the machine's own ACPI VFCT table at
boot.

Linux kernel reference headers. Files under docs/linux-ref/ are unmodified
copies of Linux sources under their own licences (GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-
note / MIT as marked in each file), fetched by tools/fetch_linux_ref.sh and NOT
tracked here. docs/UPSTREAM.md records the commit each one came from. This
project follows their register definitions and documented sequences; the code
in src/ is its own.

Lilu. Built against Lilu (third_party/, not tracked), which is distributed
under its own terms by its authors.
